Please install the Specweave Pollinations Image Generation MCP server for me. 

Find my global Claude Desktop configuration file (claude_desktop_config.json) depending on my OS, read its contents, and securely add this server configuration to the "mcpServers" object:

{
  "command": "npx",
  "args": ["-y", "@specweave-ui/mcp-server-pollinations"],
  "env": {}
}

Name the server key "specweave-pollinations-images". If the file or the "mcpServers" key does not exist yet, please initialize them properly without losing any of my other configuration keys.
